en:
Ryo Asuka
Akira, so this is the {p}
you told me about...

jp:
{p}
ちょっと待ってよ えん魔くん
この人 様子が変だよ…

en:
{p}
Hold on, Enma-kun. Something's off
about him...

jp:
{p}
鬼仏衆？ もしかして 君が
手天童子郎くん？

en:
{p}
Kibutsu Clan? Could you be... Jiro
Shutendo-kun?

jp:
{p}
実はさっき 鬼仏衆ってヤツらに
襲われたんだ

en:
{p}
Actually, some guys called the Kibutsu
Clan attacked us just now.

jp:
{p}
美雪さんって
君の恋人…？

en:
{p}
This Miyuki-san... is she your
girlfriend...?

{p}
I want to go back to my own world!

I need clues to get there!

jp:
{p}
…邪腕坊って
人間だったみたいだけど…？

en:
{p}
...That Jawanbo seemed like he was
human...?

{p}
So why are the Kibutsu Clan after you,
Jiro-kun?

jp:
{p}
よし！
僕らも行くぞ えん魔くん！
